@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}

### [Setup][Quotes] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Quotes] Login as admin (MechanicOnly prerequisite)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{AdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{AdminPassword}}"
}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Quotes] All quotes, no expired filter (200 expected)
# @name allQuotes
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes?page=1&pageSize=1

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Quotes] expired=true keeps only expired quotes (200 expected)
# COVERAGE GAP: a Sent quote can only expire as time passes (ValidUntil cannot be created in the past), so on a fresh database this holds vacuously.
# @name expiredQuotes
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes?expired=true&page=1&pageSize=500

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.items.every(q => q.isExpired && q.status == "Sent")) == true

###

### [Positive][Quotes] expired=false excludes expired quotes (200 expected)
# @name activeQuotes
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes?expired=false&page=1&pageSize=500

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.items.every(q => !q.isExpired)) == true
?? js response.parsedBody.totalCount >= 1

###

### [Case][Quotes] expired=true and expired=false split the whole list (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes?page=1&pageSize=1

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.totalCount == expiredQuotes.totalCount + activeQuotes.totalCount) == true

###

### [Positive][Quotes] status=Sent with expired=false is the Sent chip: Sent and not expired (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes?status=Sent&expired=false&page=1&pageSize=500

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.items.every(q => q.status == "Sent" && !q.isExpired)) == true

###

### [Negative][Quotes] expired=maybe is not a boolean (400 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes?expired=maybe

?? status == 400
